<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.8000 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.8000 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.5000 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Feb 24		  Feb 21</p>
<p> High			     75.4000		 75.1500</p>
<p> Low				75.8500		 75.5000</p>
<p> Open			     75.7000		 75.1550</p>
<p> Close			    75.8000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	    3.855		   2.960</p>
<p> TENGE PER MARK		 Feb 24		  Feb 21</p>
<p> High			     45.4100		 44.9000</p>
